{"version":1,"content":"<p>網絡安全機構 Ostorlab 發佈《2026 移動銀行應用安全報告》，這是該年度報告首次將華為鴻蒙系統（HarmonyOS）納入評估範圍。本次研究共分析了來自全球 64 個國家、487 家銀行的 2686 款手機銀行 App，其中有 478 款來自華為應用市場（AppGallery）。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586258.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:44.784184+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:40:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:01.426993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:01.426993+00:00","content_hash":"c6bd4727014d1e9c5607f6dad41679382e5ce7158673644df5a7ea2b2d037b33","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}